<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFREN HALF YR SHR, DIV RISES.</title>
<headline>SAFREN HALF YR SHR, DIV RISES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31,</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr (cts)     </p>
<p>    - pre-exceps	    45.6	  vs 39.1</p>
<p>    - post exceps	   46.8	  vs 41.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 9.5	   vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Earnings pre-exceps   253.8	 vs 217.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   557.0	 vs 526.7</p>
<p>    Tax			 125.0	 vs 119.1</p>
<p>    Net interest paid     34.0	  vs 29.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		  4,227.9     vs 3,121.1</p>
<p>Div payable April 16</p>
<p>on register March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Safmarine and Rennies Holdings Ltd  </p>
<p>    Exceptional items     10.3	  vs 17.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The group did not detail the nature of the</p>
<p>exceptional item.</p>
<p>Directors said trading conditions were unlikely to change</p>
<p>significantly in the second six months and earnings before</p>
<p>exceptional items should show acceptable growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
